    <string name="about_etymology">Diaita (δίαιτα, ancient Greek) means “a way of living” — it’s where the word “diet” comes from. The Greeks meant your whole lifestyle, not two weeks of celery and regret. So let’s make it a way of living.</string>
    <string name="about_description">Diaita is a simple calorie, macro and weight tracker built for everyday use — log meals in seconds, reuse presets and keep an eye on your pace through the day.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy">All your data stays on this device. No accounts, no cloud, no tracking.</string>

